<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 4.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 4.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 4	Feb 3	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  259.600     259.380     247.020    5.09 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  305.850     304.800     306.830   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.175     157.660     158.970   -0.50 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.792	46.692	47.182   -0.83 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  421.200     416.020     419.180    0.48 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.835     140.365     141.685   -0.60 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.033	15.984	16.185   -0.94 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.590     212.800     212.430    0.08 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.865	 1.858	 1.888   -1.22 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.574	 1.570	 1.581   -0.44 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  182.430     181.690     183.135   -0.38 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
